{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T21:20:20.562Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"436e44ca2d204a1ee603915a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.317","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1657"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1657: release notes mark SDK contract changes with a migration line instead of shipping them under Fixed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Between 2026.10.25 and 2026.10.30 seven changes altered observable SDK behaviour (GH-1554, GH-1577 pm-gh1577, GH-1583, GH-1591 pm-pllp78, GH-1613, GH-1614 pm-gh1614, GH-1617). Six shipped under Fixed and one under Security, none with a migration line, and one Dependabot bump broke 9 of 34 downstream extensions. pm-cli side: a way to declare an item a contract change with a before/after/migrate line, and a release check that requires that declaration when the public SDK surface snapshot or a documented default changes. pm-changelog side (fix in the pm-changelog repo, not here): render a Changed (SDK contract) section from that declaration, and expose it in changelog JSON for fleets."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["changelog","ecosystem","gh:1657","release","sdk"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-03T21:20:20.562Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T21:20:20.562Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value"